id=ct_ims_autoinject
name=China Telecom IMS Auto-Inject
version=v2.4
versionCode=7
author=ifchy
description=Boot: re-applies China Telecom (中国电信) VoLTE/VoNR/VT carrier-config (VoWiFi off) + restarts IMS (headless, root). Then T-Mobile eSIM -> Wi-Fi Calling / 备用通话 only in China: cross-SIM calling over CT data + manual home-PLMN selection so it never roams on CMCC/CU (auto selection restored outside China). Action re-applies it.
